<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-7481] Suspended transaction rollbacs incorrectly  </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7481</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When we suspend transaction, and then timeout occures , transaction would be rollbacked incorrectly.&lt;br/&gt;
One of incorrect behaviors : rollback\end tx metrics are not incremented.&lt;br/&gt;
Thre reason is that transactionMap is cleared when we suspend transaction.&lt;br/&gt;
We need not clear transactionMap.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
